<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to visit southern Japan Oct 28-29.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to visit southern Japan Oct 28-29.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will visit the southern Japanese prefectures of Kagoshima and Miyazaki on October 28 and 29 to meet business executives there, the BOJ said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Matsushita does not plan to hold a news conference there, a BOJ spokesman said.</p>
